    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG303 · Assessment 2/4</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13428 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG303 · Đầu điểm 2/4</span>\n<h2>Practice 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13428 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">1 practice/sesson 11 to sesson 24/ in class and at home</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">practical exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to submit the following deliverables:1. Story idea.2. Hard copy of the flipbook, properly bound and neatly finished.3. Soft copy of the flipbook, in high resolution and MP4 format, including background music, sound effects, intro, and outro.4. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Flipbook</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Assessment Regulations<br><br>+ Assignments are first displayed and evaluated by students, then formally assessed and graded by the lecturer.<br><br>+ Students will receive guidance and support from the lecturer throughout the process.<br><br>-AI Usage Regulations<br><br>+ Students are allowed to use any generative AI tools to search for secondary data and generate ideas. However, they must independently construct the final product in accordance with the conditions and requirements of the assignment.<br><br>+ Students must submit an AI usage report describing the process, including screenshots that illustrate the steps taken.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Task<br><br>1. Students may use AI to search for script ideas, edit and present the script in a scientific manner, and support storyboard development.<br><br>Tools: Can be done on paper or with graphic software such as Adobe Photoshop, Krita, etc.<br><br>2. Produce layout animation and key frames.<br><br>Tools: Hand-drawn on Flipbook paper or A5–A6 paper.<br><br>3. Draw inbetweens to complete the animation product.<br><br>Tools: Hand-drawn on Flipbook paper or A5–A6 paper.<br><br>4. Students present their work for instructor’s feedback and grading.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
