    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG303 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG303 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Fluid Frames: Experimental Animation with Sand, Clay, Paint, and Pixels</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Corrie Francis Parks · CRC Press · 2016 · 1st edition · ISBN <code>ISBN-10 : 1138784915ISBN-13 : 978-1138784918</code></p><p>“Use both textbooks as the main learning materials.”</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Frame by frame Stop Motion: The guide to Non-puppet Photographic Animation Techniques.</strong></p><p>Tom Gasek · CRC Press · 2017 · Second Edition · ISBN <code>ISBN-10 : 149878061XISBN-13 : 978-1498780612</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Illusion of Life: Disney Animation</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Ollie Johnston, Frank Thomas · Abbeville Press · 1995 · 1st edition · ISBN <code>ISBN-10 : 0786860707ISBN-13 : 978-0786860708</code></p><p>“Use both textbooks as the main learning materials.”</p></div>"
